<title>USA: Elek-Tek Inc Q4 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Elek-Tek Inc Q4 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SKOKIE, Ill. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.63     loss	$ 0.21</p>
<p> Net loss		   3,977     loss	 1,276</p>
<p> Revs			84,888		   96,233</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,300		    6,300</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 includes $600,000 in pre-tax special charges reflecting increases in reserves related to disputed balances. The company previously reported recognition of $6.4 million (pre-tax) in special charges during the 1996 Q2.</p>
